        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    home_price = 500_000\n    first_principal = home_price * 0.80\n    second_principal = home_price * 0.10\n\n    first_rate = 0.035 / 12\n    first_payments = 30 * 12\n    first_monthly_payment = (\n        first_principal * first_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + first_rate) ** -first_payments)\n    )\n\n    second_rate = 0.06 / 12\n    second_payments = 15 * 12\n    second_monthly_payment = (\n        second_principal * second_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + second_rate) ** -second_payments)\n    )\n\n    answer = round(first_monthly_payment + second_monthly_payment)\n    return answer\n```",
